      "subject": "taba e tla wa bjang",
      "rationale": "Seheberu: יפל דבר — 'taba e wa' — go bolela phetho ya taba; phetolelo ya tlwaelo ya Sepedi 'e tla wa bjang' e bolokwa."
    },
    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "כי אם",
      "rationale": "Sehlaganyi sa Seheberu 'כי אם' se ra 'ntle le ge' — phetolelo ya go ganetša ye e theilwego godimo ga ישקט 'go phomola'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "go Ruthe",
      "rationale": "Noomi o laela morwediwa ka gobedi gore a dule a emetše — bolelo ka go lebanya."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme o ile a re: Dula, morwediwa ka, go fihlela o tseba gore taba e tla wa bjang; ka gobane monna yoo ga a ka ke a phomola, ntle le ge a phethile ⟨kle⟩ taba lehono.",
